Anatoli is a silver-scaled [[Bestiary/Rule of Beasts#Dray|Dray]] in his mid-40s. He has curling, bony protrusions extending out of his collarbone, which he modifies his suits to display.

Anatoli is a locomotive engineer originally from [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oresk]] who now works for the [[Org/Althane/Ghost Coal Chain Gang|Ghost Coal Chain Gang]]. He travels with his assistant/adoptive daughter [[People/Althane/Burr|Burr]].
